#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_check_stock
msgid ""
"Checks the stock levels of products by name or internal reference.\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user says: \"how many X do we have\", \"产品A还有多少库存\", \"check stock before quoting\".\n"
"\n"
"Returns per matching product: on hand, forecasted, incoming and outgoing quantities.\n"
"Read-only: no confirmation needed. Good practice: check stock BEFORE creating sales orders for physical products."
msgstr ""
"按名称或内部参考号检查产品的库存水平。\n"
"\n"
"当用户说：\"how many X do we have\"、\"产品A还有多少库存\"、\"check stock before quoting\" 时使用。\n"
"\n"
"针对每个匹配的产品返回：在手数量、预测数量、入库和出库数量。\n"
"只读：无需确认。最佳实践：在为实体产品创建销售订单之前，先检查库存。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_mrp_action_check_components
msgid ""
"Checks whether enough component stock exists to manufacture a given quantity of a product: explodes the BOM one level, computes the required quantity per component (scaled to the requested quantity) and compares with free stock. Reports exact shortages.\n"
"Read-only, no confirmation needed. ALWAYS run this before creating or confirming a manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"检查组件库存是否足以制造指定数量的产品：将物料清单 (BOM) 展开一层，按请求数量折算每个组件的需求量，并与可用库存比较。精确报告缺料情况。\n"
"只读，无需确认。在创建或确认制造订单之前，务必先运行此工具。"

