#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_configure_product_variants
msgid ""
"Configures attributes and variants on an EXISTING product in ONE atomic call: finds or creates the attributes (e.g. 厂地/厚度), finds or creates their values, links them to the product's variant attribute lines, and lets Odoo generate the variants. Optionally sets a unit of measure (found or created by name).\n"
"\n"
"Use whenever a product needs attributes/variants (\"PVC板,属性厂地:昆明,成都,厚度:5mm,8mm\") — NEVER build product.attribute / product.attribute.value / product.template.attribute.line records one by one with the generic Create Record skill.\n"
"Idempotent: existing attributes/values are reused, already-linked values are kept, missing ones are added.\n"
"Returns the full variant list with IDs — use those IDs (or 'name(值1,值2)' syntax) in order lines afterwards."
msgstr ""
"在一次原子调用中为已存在的产品配置属性和变体：查找或创建属性（如 厂地/厚度），查找或创建属性值，将其关联到产品的变体属性明细行，并由 Odoo 生成变体。可选择设置计量单位（按名称查找或创建）。\n"
"\n"
"每当产品需要属性/变体时使用（\"PVC板,属性厂地:昆明,成都,厚度:5mm,8mm\"）— 切勿使用通用的 Create Record 技能逐条创建 product.attribute / product.attribute.value / product.template.attribute.line 记录。\n"
"幂等：已存在的属性/值会被复用，已关联的值会被保留，缺失的会被补充。\n"
"返回包含 ID 的完整变体列表 — 之后在订单明细中使用这些 ID（或 'name(值1,值2)' 语法）。"

