msgstr "确认"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_mrp_action_confirm_mo
msgid ""
"Confirms a DRAFT manufacturing order and tries to reserve its components. "
"Reports the resulting state and the real component reservation status "
"honestly — a confirmed MO with missing components is reported as such, never"
" as ready."
msgstr "确认一张草稿状态的制造订单并尝试预留其组件。如实报告最终状态和组件的真实预留情况 — 缺少组件的已确认制造订单会如实报告，绝不会被报告为就绪。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_confirm_document
msgid ""
"Confirms or approves an Odoo document, changing its status to the next stage.\n"
"\n"
"Supported documents and what \"confirm\" means for each:\n"
"- Quotation / Sales Order (sale.order) → Confirms and converts to Sales Order\n"
"- Invoice / Bill (account.move) → Posts the invoice, making it official\n"
"- Purchase Order (purchase.order) → Confirms the PO to the vendor\n"
"- Delivery / Transfer (stock.picking) → Validates the transfer as done\n"
"- Manufacturing Order (mrp.production) → Confirms the production plan\n"
"- Payment (account.payment) → Posts the payment entry\n"
"- Expense Report (hr.expense.sheet) → Submits the expense for approval\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user says: \"confirm\", \"approve\", \"validate\", \"post\", \"finalize\", \"convert to order\".\n"
"Examples:\n"
"- \"confirm quotation S00001\"\n"
"- \"approve this purchase order\"\n"
"- \"validate the delivery for Rocky\"\n"
"- \"post invoice INV/2026/00001\"\n"
"\n"
"Safety: Will NOT proceed if multiple matching documents are found — asks user to specify exact reference.\n"
"Only acts on documents in a confirmable state (draft, sent, etc.).\n"
"Returns the updated document status on success."
msgstr ""
"确认或批准一份 Odoo 单据，将其状态推进到下一阶段。\n"
"\n"
"支持的单据以及\"确认\"对各类单据的含义：\n"
"- 报价单 / 销售订单 (sale.order) → 确认并转为销售订单\n"
"- 发票 / 账单 (account.move) → 将发票过账，使其正式生效\n"
"- 采购订单 (purchase.order) → 向供应商确认采购订单\n"
"- 交货 / 调拨 (stock.picking) → 将调拨验证为完成\n"
"- 制造订单 (mrp.production) → 确认生产计划\n"
"- 付款 (account.payment) → 将付款分录过账\n"
"- 费用报告 (hr.expense.sheet) → 提交费用以待审批\n"
"\n"
"当用户说：\"confirm\"、\"approve\"、\"validate\"、\"post\"、\"finalize\"、\"convert to order\" 时使用。\n"
"示例：\n"
"- \"confirm quotation S00001\"\n"
"- \"approve this purchase order\"\n"
"- \"validate the delivery for Rocky\"\n"
"- \"post invoice INV/2026/00001\"\n"
"\n"
"安全：若找到多份匹配单据将不会继续 — 会要求用户指定确切的单据编号。\n"
"仅对处于可确认状态（草稿、已发送等）的单据执行操作。\n"
"成功时返回更新后的单据状态。"

