#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_mrp_action_create_mo
msgid ""
"Creates a DRAFT manufacturing order for a product (exact variant required when the product has variants) using its BOM. The MO reference is assigned by the system — never invent one.\n"
"Requires an existing BOM ('AI MRP: Create BOM' first if missing). Check component availability BEFORE creating. Confirming is a separate step ('AI MRP: Confirm Manufacturing Order')."
msgstr ""
"使用产品的物料清单 (BOM) 为其创建一张草稿状态的制造订单（产品有变体时必须指定确切变体）。制造订单编号由系统分配 — 切勿自行编造。\n"
"需要已存在的 BOM（若缺失请先运行 'AI MRP: Create BOM'）。创建之前先检查组件可用性。确认是单独的步骤（'AI MRP: Confirm Manufacturing Order'）。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_create_view
msgid ""
"Creates a brand-new standalone list, form or kanban view for any model.\n"
"Use when the user wants to CREATE a new view, not modify an existing one.\n"
"To ADD content to an existing view, use 'AI Studio: Extend View' instead.\n"
"\n"
"Validates all field names exist before creating.\n"
"Can also create a window action (act_window) for linking to a menu.\n"
"\n"
"Returns view ID and key on success."
msgstr ""
"为任意模型创建全新的独立列表、表单或看板视图。\n"
"当用户想创建新视图而非修改现有视图时使用。\n"
"要向现有视图添加内容，请改用 'AI Studio: Extend View'。\n"
"\n"
"创建前会验证所有字段名是否存在。\n"
"还可以创建窗口动作 (act_window)，以便关联到菜单。\n"
"\n"
"成功时返回视图 ID 和 key。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_mrp_action_create_bom
msgid ""
"Creates a complete Bill of Materials in ONE atomic call: finished product (variant-specific BOM supported), base quantity, type (manufacture or kit), and all component lines with quantities.\n"
"\n"
"Components are resolved variant-aware ('PVC板(昆明,8mm)') and must ALREADY exist as products — this tool never invents or auto-creates components (accuracy first). A product cannot be its own component.\n"
"If a BOM already exists for the product the call is BLOCKED and returns it; retry with update_existing='true' to add missing components / update differing quantities on the existing BOM.\n"
"Returns the BOM ID and full line list."
msgstr ""
"在一次原子调用中创建完整的物料清单 (BOM)：成品（支持按变体的 BOM）、基础数量、类型（制造或套件），以及所有组件明细行及其数量。\n"
"\n"
"组件按变体感知方式解析（'PVC板(昆明,8mm)'），且必须已作为产品存在 — 此工具绝不虚构或自动创建组件（准确性优先）。产品不能是其自身的组件。\n"
"若该产品已存在 BOM，则调用会被阻止并返回该 BOM；可携带 update_existing='true' 重试，以在现有 BOM 上补充缺失组件 / 更新数量差异。\n"
"返回 BOM ID 和完整明细行列表。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_add_field
msgid ""
"Creates a custom field (x_ prefix) on any Odoo model.\n"
"\n"
"Use when user says: 'add a field', 'create a custom field', 'I need a new column'.\n"
"\n"
"Workflow:\n"
"1. If unsure of model name → call 'AI Studio: Get Models' first\n"
"2. Call this tool to create the field\n"
"3. After success, offer to add it to a view using 'AI Studio: Get Views' + 'AI Studio: Extend View'\n"
"\n"
"Field types: char (text line), text (multiline), integer, float, boolean, date, datetime,\n"
"selection (dropdown), many2one (link to another record), monetary, html, binary (file)\n"
"\n"
"For selection: provide comma-separated options e.g. 'Bronze, Silver, Gold'\n"
"For many2one: provide the related model e.g. 'res.partner'\n"
"\n"
"Returns the created field technical name (needed for Extend View)."
msgstr ""
"在任意 Odoo 模型上创建自定义字段（x_ 前缀）。\n"
"\n"
"当用户说：'add a field'、'create a custom field'、'I need a new column' 时使用。\n"
"\n"
"工作流程：\n"
"1. 若不确定模型名称 → 先调用 'AI Studio: Get Models'\n"
"2. 调用本工具创建字段\n"
"3. 成功后，提议使用 'AI Studio: Get Views' + 'AI Studio: Extend View' 将其添加到视图\n"
"\n"
"字段类型：char（单行文本）、text（多行文本）、integer、float、boolean、date、datetime、\n"
"selection（下拉选择）、many2one（关联到其他记录）、monetary、html、binary（文件）\n"
"\n"
"selection 类型：提供逗号分隔的选项，例如 'Bronze, Silver, Gold'\n"
"many2one 类型：提供关联模型，例如 'res.partner'\n"
"\n"
"返回所创建字段的技术名称（Extend View 需要用到）。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_skill_builder_action_create_draft
msgid ""
"Creates a new AI skill as an INACTIVE draft. Drafts are invisible to all agents until activated.\n"
"\n"
"Before calling: confirm the model with Get Models, the field names with Search Fields, and check List Skills for duplicates.\n"
"The schema and code are validated on creation; if rejected, fix the issue and try again.\n"
"After creation, ALWAYS run Test Run Skill."
msgstr ""
"以未激活草稿的形式创建一个新的 AI 技能。草稿在激活前对所有智能体不可见。\n"
"\n"
"调用之前：用 Get Models 确认模型，用 Search Fields 确认字段名，并检查 List Skills 是否已有重复。\n"
"schema 和代码会在创建时校验；如被拒绝，请修复问题后重试。\n"
"创建之后，务必运行 Test Run Skill。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_create_record
msgid ""
"Creates one record in any Odoo model (\"create a contact\", \"add an order line\" — master data and documents alike).\n"
"\n"
"Call Get Model Fields first. Many2one values are resolved by display name with anti-duplicate guards; exact-name duplicates on master data are blocked. Full parameter semantics: load the skill guide.\n"
"Returns the new record ID and name."
msgstr ""
"在任意 Odoo 模型中创建一条记录（\"create a contact\"、\"add an order line\" — 主数据和单据均可）。\n"
"\n"
"请先调用 Get Model Fields。Many2one 值按显示名称解析并带有防重复保护；主数据上名称完全相同的重复会被阻止。完整参数语义：请加载技能指南。\n"
"返回新记录的 ID 和名称。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_create_invoice_from_order
msgid ""
"Creates the customer invoice from a CONFIRMED sales order via the official Odoo invoicing flow (never build account.move manually).\n"
"\n"
"The result is a DRAFT invoice with no final number yet (assigned at posting); posting (action_post) is a separate confirmed step. Follow the confirmation protocol."
msgstr ""
"通过 Odoo 官方开票流程从已确认的销售订单创建客户发票（切勿手工构建 account.move）。\n"
"\n"
"结果是一张草稿发票，尚无最终编号（过账时分配）；过账 (action_post) 是需单独确认的步骤。请遵循确认协议。"

