#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_rollback_view
msgid ""
"Deletes (rolls back) a view created by AI Studio.\n"
"Only works on views with key starting with 'ai_studio.' — system views are protected.\n"
"Call 'AI Studio: List My Views' first to get the view ID.\n"
"After rollback, refresh browser to see the change reverted.\n"
"Returns confirmation on success."
msgstr ""
"删除（回滚）由 AI Studio 创建的视图。\n"
"仅适用于 key 以 'ai_studio.' 开头的视图 — 系统视图受保护。\n"
"请先调用 'AI Studio: List My Views' 获取视图 ID。\n"
"回滚后刷新浏览器即可看到更改已还原。\n"
"成功时返回确认信息。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_delete_field
msgid ""
"Deletes a custom field (x_ prefix, state=manual) from a model.\n"
"Refuses to delete system fields — only manually created x_ fields can be removed.\n"
"WARNING: deleting a field also removes all data stored in it and may break views that use it.\n"
"Always rollback related views first, then delete the field.\n"
"Returns confirmation on success."
msgstr ""
"从模型中删除一个自定义字段（x_ 前缀，state=manual）。\n"
"拒绝删除系统字段 — 只能移除手动创建的 x_ 字段。\n"
"警告：删除字段会同时删除其中存储的所有数据，并可能破坏使用该字段的视图。\n"
"请务必先回滚相关视图，再删除字段。\n"
"成功时返回确认信息。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_delete_menu
msgid ""
"Deletes a menu item and its associated window action.\n"
"Use when user wants to remove a menu created by AI Studio.\n"
"Call with the menu ID from 'AI Studio: Create Menu' or from Settings > Technical > Menus.\n"
"Returns confirmation on success."
msgstr ""
"删除一个菜单项及其关联的窗口动作。\n"
"当用户想移除由 AI Studio 创建的菜单时使用。\n"
"使用来自 'AI Studio: Create Menu' 或 设置 > 技术 > 菜单 的菜单 ID 进行调用。\n"
"成功时返回确认信息。"

