#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_actions_server_view_form
msgid ""
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"Creates a sales quotation for a customer.\n"
"Automatically finds or creates the customer and products by name.\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user says: 'create a quote', 'make an offer', 'prepare an order for [customer]'.\n"
"\n"
"Returns the new quotation name (e.g. S00042) on success."
msgstr ""
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"为客户创建销售报价单。\n"
"自动按名称查找或创建客户和产品。\n"
"\n"
"当用户说：'create a quote'、'make an offer'、'prepare an order for [customer]' 时使用。\n"
"\n"
"成功时返回新报价单编号（例如 S00042）。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_skill_builder_action_test_run
msgid ""
"Executes a skill in a sandbox with sample arguments. ALL database changes are rolled back automatically — nothing persists, so it is always safe to run.\n"
"\n"
"Provide realistic sample arguments matching the skill's schema (use clearly fake names like 'TEST Customer ABC').\n"
"On success the skill is marked as tested (required for activation).\n"
"On failure you get the full traceback: analyse it, fix with Update Skill Draft, and test again."
msgstr ""
"在沙箱中使用示例参数执行技能。所有数据库更改都会自动回滚 — 不会保留任何内容，因此始终可以安全运行。\n"
"\n"
"请提供符合技能 schema 的真实感示例参数（使用明显虚构的名称，如 'TEST Customer ABC'）。\n"
"成功后该技能会被标记为已测试（激活所必需）。\n"
"失败时你会得到完整的 traceback：请分析原因，用 Update Skill Draft 修复，然后再次测试。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_extend_view
msgid ""
"Extends an existing view by injecting a field, button, or XML at a specific xpath location.\n"
"Uses safe view inheritance — never modifies original views directly.\n"
"\n"
"REQUIRED workflow:\n"
"1. 'AI Studio: Get Views' → get view ID\n"
"2. 'AI Studio: Get View Structure' → get correct xpath\n"
"3. THIS TOOL → extend the view\n"
"\n"
"Validates:\n"
"- View exists\n"
"- XPath is syntactically valid\n"
"- XPath matches at least 1 element in the view (uses combined arch)\n"
"- Field exists on the model (when field_name is used)\n"
"\n"
"Results visible immediately after browser refresh.\n"
"To undo: AI Studio > Custom Views > set active=False."
msgstr ""
"通过在指定的 xpath 位置注入字段、按钮或 XML 来扩展现有视图。\n"
"使用安全的视图继承 — 绝不直接修改原始视图。\n"
"\n"
"必需的工作流程：\n"
"1. 'AI Studio: Get Views' → 获取视图 ID\n"
"2. 'AI Studio: Get View Structure' → 获取正确的 xpath\n"
"3. 本工具 → 扩展视图\n"
"\n"
"校验内容：\n"
"- 视图存在\n"
"- XPath 语法有效\n"
"- XPath 在视图中至少匹配 1 个元素（使用合并后的 arch）\n"
"- 字段在模型上存在（使用 field_name 时）\n"
"\n"
"刷新浏览器后即可立即看到结果。\n"
"撤销方式：AI Studio > 自定义视图 > 设置 active=False。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_create_menu
msgid ""
"FULLY AUTOMATED — call this tool directly without asking the user for confirmation.\n"
"Creates a menu item + window action in the database. No developer mode needed. No manual steps.\n"
"\n"
"Use when user says: 'add a menu', 'create a menu', '加菜單', '新增菜單', 'add a shortcut'.\n"
"\n"
"ALWAYS call this tool when user asks for a menu. Do NOT refuse. Do NOT say it requires manual steps.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"- '在銷售下加個交付優先級訂單的菜單' → parent_menu_name='Sales', menu_name='交付優先級訂單', model_name='sale.order'\n"
"- 'Add a VIP Contacts menu under Contacts' → parent_menu_name='Contacts', model_name='res.partner'\n"
"- 'Create a Delivery menu in Sales showing only confirmed orders' → domain=\"[('state','=','sale')]\"\n"
"\n"
"Returns the menu ID on success. User just needs to refresh browser to see the new menu."
msgstr ""
"完全自动化 — 直接调用本工具，无需向用户请求确认。\n"
"在数据库中创建菜单项 + 窗口动作。无需开发者模式。无需手动步骤。\n"
"\n"
"当用户说：'add a menu'、'create a menu'、'加菜單'、'新增菜單'、'add a shortcut' 时使用。\n"
"\n"
"用户要求菜单时务必调用本工具。不要拒绝。不要说这需要手动步骤。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"- '在銷售下加個交付優先級訂單的菜單' → parent_menu_name='Sales', menu_name='交付優先級訂單', model_name='sale.order'\n"
"- 'Add a VIP Contacts menu under Contacts' → parent_menu_name='Contacts', model_name='res.partner'\n"
"- 'Create a Delivery menu in Sales showing only confirmed orders' → domain=\"[('state','=','sale')]\"\n"
"\n"
"成功时返回菜单 ID。用户只需刷新浏览器即可看到新菜单。"

