#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_send_report_pdf
msgid ""
"Generates a PDF report for an Odoo document and sends the download link to the current chat.\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user asks for a PDF, wants to download a report, or says things like:\n"
"- \"send me the PDF of quotation S00001\"\n"
"- \"generate the PDF for this order\"\n"
"- \"I need the quotation PDF for Rocky\"\n"
"\n"
"Supports these document types (report_type):\n"
"- \"quotation\" or \"sale_order\" → Sales Quotation / Order\n"
"- \"invoice\" → Customer Invoice\n"
"- \"purchase_order\" → Purchase Order\n"
"\n"
"Returns: confirmation that the link was posted to chat."
msgstr ""
"为 Odoo 单据生成 PDF 报告，并将下载链接发送到当前聊天。\n"
"\n"
"当用户索取 PDF、想下载报告，或说出类似下面的话时使用：\n"
"- “把报价单 S00001 的 PDF 发给我”\n"
"- “为这个订单生成 PDF”\n"
"- “我需要 Rocky 的报价单 PDF”\n"
"\n"
"支持以下单据类型 (report_type)：\n"
"- \"quotation\" 或 \"sale_order\" → 销售报价单/订单\n"
"- \"invoice\" → 客户发票\n"
"- \"purchase_order\" → 采购订单\n"
"\n"
"返回：链接已发布到聊天的确认信息。"

