#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_chatbot_enhance.field_ir_actions_server__ai_tool_confirmation_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_chatbot_enhance.field_ir_cron__ai_tool_confirmation_policy
msgid ""
"Hard gate enforced in chat: the tool only executes when the user's latest "
"message explicitly confirms a preview the AI just showed (confirm card "
"clicked or typed approval). 'Auto' requires confirmation for every data-"
"changing operation and skips it for read-only/print tools. Automated flows "
"(record AI actions without a chat channel) are never gated."
msgstr ""
"在聊天中强制执行的硬性门槛：只有当用户的最新消息明确确认了 AI 刚刚展示的预览"
"（点击确认卡片或输入同意）时，工具才会执行。'Auto' 表示对每个更改数据的操作都要求确认，"
"而对只读/打印工具则跳过确认。自动化流程（没有聊天频道的记录 AI 动作）永远不会被拦截。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_chatbot_enhance.field_ir_actions_server__ai_tool_requires_guide
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_chatbot_enhance.field_ir_cron__ai_tool_requires_guide
msgid ""
"Hard gate: the AI must load a skill guide (get_skill_guide tool) in the "
"current turn before this tool will execute. Use for mutation tools to "
"guarantee the AI works with the full domain handbook in context."
msgstr ""
"硬性门槛：AI 必须在当前轮次先加载技能指南（get_skill_guide 工具），此工具才会执行。"
"用于变更类工具，以确保 AI 在上下文中掌握完整的领域手册。"

