#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_skill_builder_action_list_skills
msgid ""
"Lists all AI skills: drafts and active ones, custom and built-in.\n"
"\n"
"Call this BEFORE creating a new skill to check whether a similar one already exists.\n"
"Built-in skills are read-only but excellent examples: read them with Get Skill Details."
msgstr ""
"列出所有 AI 技能：草稿和已启用的、自定义的和内置的。\n"
"\n"
"在创建新技能之前先调用此工具，检查是否已存在类似的技能。\n"
"内置技能为只读，但却是极好的范例：可通过 Get Skill Details 阅读。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_get_models
msgid ""
"Lists all available Odoo models (technical names and display names).\n"
"Call this FIRST when the user mentions a model name you are not 100% sure about.\n"
"Helps find the correct technical name (e.g. 'res.partner', 'sale.order', 'account.move').\n"
"Returns a formatted table of model technical names and display names."
msgstr ""
"列出所有可用的 Odoo 模型（技术名称和显示名称）。\n"
"当用户提到一个你不能 100% 确定的模型名称时，请首先调用此工具。\n"
"帮助找到正确的技术名称（例如 'res.partner'、'sale.order'、'account.move'）。\n"
"返回模型技术名称和显示名称的格式化表格。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_list_menus
msgid ""
"Lists all menus created by AI Studio.\n"
"Use this before deleting a menu to find its ID.\n"
"Returns menu ID, name, parent location, and which model it opens.\n"
"Automatically cleans up any stale references to deleted menus."
msgstr ""
"列出所有由 AI Studio 创建的菜单。\n"
"删除菜单前使用此工具查找其 ID。\n"
"返回菜单 ID、名称、上级位置以及它打开的模型。\n"
"自动清理对已删除菜单的失效引用。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_list_views
msgid ""
"Lists all views created by AI Studio (key starts with 'ai_studio.').\n"
"Use this before rollback to see what AI Studio has created.\n"
"Optionally filter by model_name. Shows view ID, type, model, name and what it extends.\n"
"Returns a list you can use with 'AI Studio: Rollback View'."
msgstr ""
"列出所有由 AI Studio 创建的视图（key 以 'ai_studio.' 开头）。\n"
"回滚前使用此工具查看 AI Studio 创建了哪些内容。\n"
"可选按 model_name 筛选。显示视图 ID、类型、模型、名称及其继承的对象。\n"
"返回的列表可与 'AI Studio: Rollback View' 一起使用。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_get_views
msgid ""
"Lists all views for a model, showing view IDs, types, names and keys.\n"
"Call this BEFORE 'AI Studio: Extend View' to find the correct view ID to extend.\n"
"After getting the view ID, call 'AI Studio: Get View Structure' to see the arch structure.\n"
"\n"
"Returns primary views (the ones to extend) and inherited views (existing extensions)."
msgstr ""
"列出某个模型的所有视图，显示视图 ID、类型、名称和 key。\n"
"在调用 'AI Studio: Extend View' 之前先调用此工具，找到要扩展的正确视图 ID。\n"
"获得视图 ID 后，调用 'AI Studio: Get View Structure' 查看 arch 结构。\n"
"\n"
"返回主视图（应扩展的视图）和继承视图（已有的扩展）。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_skill_builder_action_list_methods
msgid ""
"Lists the public business methods of an Odoo model (name, signature, first doc line).\n"
"\n"
"Use when a skill needs to call a business method (confirm an order, validate a picking, ...) and you must verify the exact method name, e.g. action_confirm on sale.order.\n"
"\n"
"Without search_term only business methods are shown; with a search_term generic ORM methods also match.\n"
"A listed name only proves the method exists — always verify actual behavior with Test Run Skill."
msgstr ""
"列出 Odoo 模型的公共业务方法（名称、签名、文档首行）。\n"
"\n"
"当技能需要调用业务方法（确认订单、验证拣货等）且必须核实确切方法名时使用，例如 sale.order 上的 action_confirm。\n"
"\n"
"不带 search_term 时只显示业务方法；带 search_term 时通用 ORM 方法也会匹配。\n"
"列出的名称仅证明该方法存在 — 请始终用 Test Run Skill 验证其实际行为。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.get_skill_guide
msgid ""
"Loads the FULL domain handbook (detailed guide) of a skill from the skill index.\n"
"\n"
"MUST be called BEFORE any data mutation (create/update/archive/confirm/invoice/email/payment/undo) — mutation tools are hard-blocked until a guide is loaded in the current turn.\n"
"Read the returned guide and follow it exactly. Read-only tools work without it."
msgstr ""
"从技能索引加载技能的完整领域手册（详细指南）。\n"
"\n"
"必须在任何数据变更（创建/更新/归档/确认/开票/邮件/付款/撤销）之前调用 — 在当前轮次加载指南之前，变更类工具会被硬性阻止。\n"
"阅读返回的指南并严格遵循。只读工具无需指南即可使用。"

