#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_mrp_action_complete_mo
msgid ""
"Marks a confirmed/in-progress manufacturing order as DONE, producing the full planned quantity (sets the produced quantity to the planned quantity if not filled). Consumes components and books the finished goods into stock — get explicit user confirmation of the quantities BEFORE calling.\n"
"If Odoo requires a manual decision (shortage, backorder, consumption warning), the tool reports it honestly and the MO must be finished in the Manufacturing app by a human. Partial production is NOT handled here."
msgstr ""
"将已确认/进行中的制造订单标记为完成，按计划数量全额生产（如未填写，则将已生产数量设为计划数量）。会消耗组件并将成品登记入库 — 调用前必须获得用户对数量的明确确认。\n"
"如果 Odoo 需要人工决策（缺料、欠单、消耗警告），此工具会如实报告，且该制造订单必须由人工在制造应用中完成。此处不处理部分生产。"

