#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_mrp_action_read_bom
msgid ""
"Reads the Bill of Materials of a product: base quantity, type (manufacture/kit), every component with quantity and unit, and whether a component has its own sub-BOM.\n"
"Read-only, no confirmation needed. Use before creating/updating a BOM or a manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"读取产品的物料清单 (BOM)：基础数量、类型（制造/套件）、每个组件的数量和单位，以及组件是否有自己的子 BOM。\n"
"只读，无需确认。在创建/更新 BOM 或制造订单之前使用。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_read_record
msgid ""
"Reads the current values of specific fields on one record (by database ID).\n"
"\n"
"Use it to:\n"
"- show the user the current state before an update (confirmation preview)\n"
"- verify the result after a create/update\n"
"- answer questions about a specific record\n"
"\n"
"Read-only: needs no confirmation."
msgstr ""
"读取单条记录（按数据库 ID）上指定字段的当前值。\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 在更新前向用户展示当前状态（确认预览）\n"
"- 在创建/更新后验证结果\n"
"- 回答有关特定记录的问题\n"
"\n"
"只读：无需确认。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_register_payment
msgid ""
"Registers a payment on a POSTED customer invoice or vendor bill, using the official Odoo payment wizard (correct journals and reconciliation).\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user says: \"register the payment for INV/2026/0001\", \"客户已付款\", \"mark this bill as paid\".\n"
"\n"
"Prerequisites: the invoice must be posted (action_post) and not fully paid yet.\n"
"Use amount 0 to pay the full remaining amount, or a positive number for a partial payment.\n"
"\n"
"This is a MUTATION with accounting consequences: follow the confirmation protocol (preview invoice, amount and remaining balance first)."
msgstr ""
"使用官方 Odoo 付款向导（正确的日记账和对账），在已过账的客户发票或供应商账单上登记付款。\n"
"\n"
"当用户说：\"register the payment for INV/2026/0001\"、\"客户已付款\"、\"mark this bill as paid\" 时使用。\n"
"\n"
"前提条件：发票必须已过账 (action_post) 且尚未全额支付。\n"
"金额填 0 表示支付全部剩余金额，填正数表示部分付款。\n"
"\n"
"这是具有会计影响的修改操作 (MUTATION)：请遵循确认流程（先预览发票、金额和剩余余额）。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_leave_balance
msgid ""
"Remaining time-off days per leave type (\"我还剩几天年假\"). Runs with the user's "
"own rights: employees can only see themselves, HR officers can query others."
" Read-only."
msgstr ""
"按休假类型查询剩余休假天数（\"我还剩几天年假\"）。以用户自身权限运行：员工只能查看自己，HR 主管可查询他人。只读。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_print_report
msgid ""
"Renders the PDF report of a record (quotation, invoice, delivery slip...) and posts it right here in the chat as an attachment the user can open/download.\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user says: \"print the quotation\", \"给我订单S00003的PDF\", \"show me the invoice document\".\n"
"\n"
"Read-only and internal: NO confirmation needed. If several reports exist for the model, the tool lists them — let the user pick with quick options."
msgstr ""
"渲染记录（报价单、发票、交货单……）的 PDF 报表，并作为附件直接发布到当前聊天中，供用户打开/下载。\n"
"\n"
"当用户说：\"print the quotation\"、\"给我订单S00003的PDF\"、\"show me the invoice document\" 时使用。\n"
"\n"
"只读且仅限内部使用：无需确认。如果该模型存在多个报表，工具会将它们列出——让用户通过快捷选项进行选择。"

