#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_get_model_fields
msgid ""
"Returns field definitions for any Odoo model.\n"
"Call this BEFORE creating or updating records to know:\n"
"- Which fields are required (must be provided)\n"
"- Field types (char, many2one, selection, boolean, etc.)\n"
"- Available options for selection fields\n"
"- Related models for many2one fields\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user wants to create or update a record and you need to know the correct field names and required fields.\n"
"\n"
"Returns: required_fields (must provide) and optional_fields (common ones). Readonly/computed fields are excluded — never try to write them."
msgstr ""
"返回任意 Odoo 模型的字段定义。\n"
"在创建或更新记录之前调用它，以了解：\n"
"- 哪些字段是必填的（必须提供）\n"
"- 字段类型（char、many2one、selection、boolean 等）\n"
"- selection 字段的可选值\n"
"- many2one 字段的关联模型\n"
"\n"
"当用户想要创建或更新记录、而你需要知道正确的字段名和必填字段时使用。\n"
"\n"
"返回：required_fields（必须提供）和 optional_fields（常用字段）。只读/计算字段已被排除——切勿尝试写入它们。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_skill_builder_action_get_skill
msgid ""
"Returns the full content of one skill: description, JSON schema, python code, status.\n"
"\n"
"Use it to:\n"
"- read a built-in skill as a reference example before writing a new one\n"
"- review a draft before updating or activating it"
msgstr ""
"返回单个技能的完整内容：描述、JSON schema、python 代码、状态。\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 在编写新技能之前，读取内置技能作为参考示例\n"
"- 在更新或激活草稿之前进行审阅"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_get_view_arch_raw
msgid ""
"Returns the raw stored arch_db XML of a specific view.\n"
"Use this to debug AI Studio-created views and verify the exact xpath and content that was stored.\n"
"Call this with the ID of an AI Studio view (from AI Studio > Custom Views) to inspect it.\n"
"Also shows: view name, model, type, key, active status, inherit_id.\n"
"Use this when a view was created but the field is not visible in the UI."
msgstr ""
"返回特定视图存储的原始 arch_db XML。\n"
"用于调试 AI Studio 创建的视图，并核实实际存储的 xpath 和内容。\n"
"使用 AI Studio 视图的 ID（来自 AI Studio > Custom Views）调用它进行检查。\n"
"还会显示：视图名称、模型、类型、key、激活状态、inherit_id。\n"
"当视图已创建但字段在界面中不可见时使用。"

