msgid ""
"Schedules a To-Do activity on a record with a deadline, optionally assigned to another user by name.\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user says: \"remind me to...\", \"schedule a follow-up\", \"add a task on this lead for tomorrow\", \"让张三下周跟进这个客户\".\n"
"\n"
"Light mutation: a short preview + confirm is enough.\n"
"Returns the created activity summary."
msgstr ""
"在记录上安排一个带截止日期的待办活动，可按姓名指派给其他用户。\n"
"\n"
"当用户说：\"remind me to...\"、\"schedule a follow-up\"、\"add a task on this lead for tomorrow\"、\"让张三下周跟进这个客户\" 时使用。\n"
"\n"
"轻量修改：简短预览 + 确认即可。\n"
"返回已创建活动的摘要。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_studio_action_search_fields
msgid ""
"Search fields on a model by technical name OR display label.\n"
"Use this to find the correct technical field name when the user refers to a field by its label.\n"
"Example: user says 'Delivery Date' → call this to find technical name 'commitment_date'.\n"
"Also use before Extend View to verify a field exists on the model.\n"
"Returns technical name, label, and type for each matching field."
msgstr ""
"按技术名称或显示标签搜索模型上的字段。\n"
"当用户用标签指代某个字段时，用它来找到正确的技术字段名。\n"
"示例：用户说 'Delivery Date' → 调用它找到技术名称 'commitment_date'。\n"
"在使用 Extend View 之前也应用它来确认字段存在于该模型上。\n"
"返回每个匹配字段的技术名称、标签和类型。"

