msgid ""
"Sends a business document (quotation, invoice, PO...) by email using the OFFICIAL Odoo template — you never write the content yourself.\n"
"\n"
"STRICT two-step: call with preview_only='true' first and show the user recipient/subject/body/attachments; send with preview_only='false' ONLY after their explicit confirmation. Emails cannot be recalled."
msgstr ""
"使用官方 Odoo 模板通过电子邮件发送业务单据（报价单、发票、采购订单……）——切勿自行撰写邮件内容。\n"
"\n"
"严格的两步流程：先以 preview_only='true' 调用，并向用户展示收件人/主题/正文/附件；仅在用户明确确认后才以 preview_only='false' 发送。邮件发出后无法撤回。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_send_email
msgid ""
"Sends a document to the customer or vendor by email using Odoo's built-in email templates.\n"
"\n"
"Supported documents:\n"
"- Quotation / Sales Order (sale.order) → Sends quotation email to customer\n"
"- Invoice (account.move) → Sends invoice email to customer\n"
"- Purchase Order (purchase.order) → Sends PO confirmation email to vendor\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user says: \"send\", \"email\", \"send to customer\", \"notify the vendor\".\n"
"Examples:\n"
"- \"send quotation S00001 to the customer\"\n"
"- \"email invoice INV/2026/00001 to Rocky\"\n"
"- \"send the PO to the vendor\"\n"
"- \"confirm and send the quotation\"\n"
"\n"
"Checks that the recipient has an email address before sending.\n"
"Safety: Will NOT proceed if multiple matching documents are found — asks user to specify exact reference.\n"
"Returns confirmation with recipient email address on success."
msgstr ""
"使用 Odoo 内置的电子邮件模板，将单据通过电子邮件发送给客户或供应商。\n"
"\n"
"支持的单据：\n"
"- 报价单 / 销售订单 (sale.order) → 向客户发送报价单邮件\n"
"- 发票 (account.move) → 向客户发送发票邮件\n"
"- 采购订单 (purchase.order) → 向供应商发送采购订单确认邮件\n"
"\n"
"当用户说：\"send\"、\"email\"、\"send to customer\"、\"notify the vendor\" 时使用。\n"
"示例：\n"
"- \"send quotation S00001 to the customer\"\n"
"- \"email invoice INV/2026/00001 to Rocky\"\n"
"- \"send the PO to the vendor\"\n"
"- \"confirm and send the quotation\"\n"
"\n"
"发送前会检查收件人是否有电子邮件地址。\n"
"安全性：如果找到多个匹配的单据，将不会继续——会要求用户提供确切的参考号。\n"
"成功后返回包含收件人电子邮件地址的确认信息。"

