#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.ai_action_trigger_record_action
msgid ""
"Triggers a standard workflow action on a record. ONLY these whitelisted actions are allowed:\n"
"- action_confirm: confirm a SALES quotation (sale.order)\n"
"- action_cancel: cancel a sales document / invoice\n"
"- action_draft: reset a sales document / invoice to draft\n"
"- action_post: post an invoice / journal entry (account.move)\n"
"- button_validate: validate a stock transfer (stock.picking)\n"
"- button_confirm: confirm a PURCHASE order (purchase.order uses button_*, not action_*)\n"
"- button_cancel: cancel a purchase order / reset an invoice\n"
"- button_draft: reset a purchase order or invoice (account.move) to draft\n"
"- action_create_invoice: create the VENDOR BILL from a confirmed purchase order\n"
"- action_assign: reserve/check availability of a stock transfer (stock.picking)\n"
"- action_approve: first approval of a time-off request (hr.leave)\n"
"- action_validate: final validation of a time-off request (hr.leave)\n"
"- action_refuse: refuse a time-off request (hr.leave)\n"
"- action_set_won: mark a CRM opportunity as WON (crm.lead)\n"
"- action_set_lost: mark a CRM opportunity as LOST (crm.lead)\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user says: \"confirm the order\", \"post the invoice\", \"validate the delivery\", \"确认采购单\", \"批准张三的请假\", \"把这个商机标记为赢单\".\n"
"\n"
"This is a MUTATION with business consequences: follow the confirmation protocol strictly (preview + confirm options)."
msgstr ""
"在记录上触发标准的工作流动作。仅允许以下白名单中的动作：\n"
"- action_confirm: 确认销售报价单 (sale.order)\n"
"- action_cancel: 取消销售单据 / 发票\n"
"- action_draft: 将销售单据 / 发票重置为草稿\n"
"- action_post: 过账发票 / 会计凭证 (account.move)\n"
"- button_validate: 验证库存调拨 (stock.picking)\n"
"- button_confirm: 确认采购订单（purchase.order 使用 button_*，而非 action_*）\n"
"- button_cancel: 取消采购订单 / 重置发票\n"
"- button_draft: 将采购订单或发票 (account.move) 重置为草稿\n"
"- action_create_invoice: 从已确认的采购订单创建供应商账单\n"
"- action_assign: 预留/检查库存调拨的可用性 (stock.picking)\n"
"- action_approve: 休假申请的初次批准 (hr.leave)\n"
"- action_validate: 休假申请的最终核准 (hr.leave)\n"
"- action_refuse: 拒绝休假申请 (hr.leave)\n"
"- action_set_won: 将 CRM 商机标记为赢单 (crm.lead)\n"
"- action_set_lost: 将 CRM 商机标记为输单 (crm.lead)\n"
"\n"
"当用户说 \"confirm the order\"、\"post the invoice\"、\"validate the delivery\"、\"确认采购单\"、\"批准张三的请假\"、\"把这个商机标记为赢单\" 时使用。\n"
"\n"
"这是具有业务后果的变更操作：请严格遵循确认协议（预览 + 确认选项）。"

#. module: ai_chatbot_enhance
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.field_ai_en_agent_source__type
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ai_chatbot_enhance.field_ir_actions_server__state
